    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Multiplayer Mayhem: 100 Players, 50 Duels</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Platform redefines multiplayer gaming. A lobby of 100 players awaits your entry, each destined to battle it out in pairs\u2014two contenders per floor. This setup guarantees relentless, head-to-head encounters where strategy, trust, and quick thinking determine who survives the chaos. Form alliances, deceive rivals, and brace yourself for a descent where every floor tells its own story of survival.<br><br><br><br><strong><i><u>Are You Ready to Survive?</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a descent into a world where every level holds a new trial, every encounter sparks tension, and alliances can shatter in an instant. The Platform invites you to redefine what it means to survive in a society on the brink of collapse. Embrace the chaos, master your fate, and show that even in the darkest depths, the human spirit can prevail.<br><br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter The Platform\u2014and let the battle for survival begin.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Multiplayer Mayhem: 100 Players, 50 Duels</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Platform redefines multiplayer gaming. A lobby of 100 players awaits your entry, each destined to battle it out in pairs\u2014two contenders per floor. This setup guarantees relentless, head-to-head encounters where strategy, trust, and quick thinking determine who survives the chaos. Form alliances, deceive rivals, and brace yourself for a descent where every floor tells its own story of survival.<br><br><br><br><strong><i><u>Are You Ready to Survive?</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a descent into a world where every level holds a new trial, every encounter sparks tension, and alliances can shatter in an instant. The Platform invites you to redefine what it means to survive in a society on the brink of collapse. Embrace the chaos, master your fate, and show that even in the darkest depths, the human spirit can prevail.<br><br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter The Platform\u2014and let the battle for survival begin.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into a towering vertical maze where every floor is a battleground for survival. In The Platform, scarce resources trickle down from an elusive upper level, igniting a brutal struggle among those desperate enough to claim them.",
